Objective: Maintain the research lab for 30 turns

Planet: Valentine's Planet
Clan: Musashi

Notes: Axis has a research facility on this planet which has discovered some interesting aspects of the meteor that created the gigantic Lake Corazon. Advance elements of your forces have taken over the base. You must defend it against the two clans currently fighting over the planet, Axis and Ayer's Hand, until the researchers can get all the information necessary.

